 s first venture was in Costa Rica\, where he became fluent in Spanish. The 
 bilingual comedian also founded comedywire.com\, the world’s largest come
 dy writing site. He has written jokes for some of the biggest celebrities\,
  CEOs and politicians\, and was honored to contribute to the 2020 Gridiron 
 Club Dinner. He has been featured multiple times on SiriusXM\, Fox Business
